      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-03-07_WidnesExaminer_art0127" n="art0127">
        <head>MeDOUGALL'S COOKERY BOOK.</head>
        <p>MeDOUGALL'S COOKERY BOOK.</p>
        <p>• Messrs. McDougall, the celebrated self-ra'; s;Alit flour manufacturers, have just issued a little cookery book, which contains manY fully prepared recipes for all kinds of Prii cakes; scones, and puddings, edited by blaP" Rivers, first-class diplomee, National Traiu;",,jg School of Cookery. The book will be any address direct from the firm, life'-.00 McDougall, Tita., German-street, Blanchester' receipt of a peity stamp.</p>
