      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-03-07_WidnesExaminer_art0161" n="art0161">
        <head>Another Woman Escapes.</head>
        <p>Another Woman Escapes.</p>
        <p>"After the birth of my fourth child I had severe organic inflammation. I used to have such terrible pains that it did not seem as though I could stand it. This continued for three long months, until two doctors decided that a surgical oper- ation was needed. "Then one of my friends recommended Lydia E. Pinkham's Vegetable Compound and after taking it for two months I was a well woman." (Name and address on request.) Women who suffer from fcmale ills should try Lydia E. Pinkham's Vegetable Compound, one of the most successful remedies the world has ever known, before submitting to a surgical operation. Write to-day for a free private book (to women only) to the Lady Manager, the Lydia E. Pinkham Medicine Co., 42a Hampstead Road, London, N.W. For 2s. 9d. she will send you a bottle of the Lydia E. Pinkham Vegetable Compound, or for 45. 6d. a much larger bottle. Any chemist will supply it at these prices.</p>
