        <p>The health and vigour of an individual de- pends upon quantity and quality of the blood. When the tissues have been at work there are thrown into the blood waste products, and if these be not eliminated, but (through any cause) detained in the blood, they influence nutritios and funesia, and finally produce organic disease. "Humanitarian." In cases of Scrofula, Scurvy, Eczema, Bad Legs, Skin and Blood Diseases, Pimples and Sores of all kinds, the effectiveness of Clarke's Blood Mix- tures is marvellous. Thousan sof wonderful cures have been effected by it. Clarke's Blood Mixture sold everywhere, at 2s. Pd. per bottle. Beware of worthless imitations knd substitutes. —Advt. 5.</p>
