        <p>MANSION HOUSE, LONDON CHAMBER OF COMMERCE AND FRENCH CHAMBER OF COMMERCE JOINT COM- MITTEE FOR THE LYONS INTERNATIONAL URBAN EXHIBITION, 1914. On MAY let, 1914, will be opened in the historic City of Lyons a great International and Urban Exhibition. It will be the apotheosis of INDUSTRY, SCIENCE AND INVENTION. The Exhibition will comprise go magnificent Palaces and Buildings, situated at the )unction of the Saone and the Rhone. , All the nations of the earth are competing for the best positions at this forthcoming festival of the Inventor and the Scien- tist, and thanks to the warm friendship uniting the hands and hearts of the French and British people, THE BRITISH SECTION HAS BEEN ASSIGNED THE PLACE OF HONOUR AT THE ENTRANCE OF THE EXIIIBITION. The magnificent Gardens will be one gigantic bouquet of flowers, trees and ornamental shrubs. Some 12,000 gardeners are engaged in the industry of preparing masterpieces. POSITION. The Exhibition is situated inside the town of Lyons. There will be a fine STADIUM and SPORTS GROUND, also a FUN CITY. As we know, all nations vie in the endeavour to capture the trade and get the largest possible share from the coffers of wealthy France. WAKE UP! ENGLAND. Germany, the United States of America, Italy and Russia, Austria, Belgium and Holland, not to count the other nations, are all taking important Sections. NOW is the time to strike, thanks to the existing friendly relations with France, to THE ENTENTE CORDIALE, to the love and respect which every Frenchman has for Great Britain, her people and products. Write for information (or call any day from g to 5.30), BRITIT REPRESENTATIVE, Lyons International Exhibition, London Chamber of Commerce, Oxford Court, Cannon-street, E.C,</p>
